{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Click. Collect. Conquer dessert.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Raccoon King Jr.</strong> on a chilled-out yet magical mission to recover the legendary <i>Sugar Foam</i>, lost by your bumbling dad in a tragic snack incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift through a world of physics-based chaos, gather strange ingredients, and rebuild your village, one sweet step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd9d <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based click-collecting</strong>\u00a0- every resource has weight, bounce, and personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ridiculous raccoon dialogues</strong>\u00a0- your dad <i>really</i> wants that foam back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of water</strong>\u00a0- Sugar Foam melts, and disaster is just one splash away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock skins &amp; sidekicks</strong>\u00a0- who knew that raccoons can have so many flavors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow your village</strong>\u00a0- sweet rewards unlock cozy upgrades</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814730?t=1756065190","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/398e35495befcd267d4ed3e4a95b3ef2ea8410b0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756065190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/168e5bb28f1513c294033f2dbc8866072a9007ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756065190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/168e5bb28f1513c294033f2dbc8866072a9007ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756065190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievemen